{"type":"message","id":"b2dac133","parentId":"8c263446","timestamp":"2026-03-24T23:31:36.879Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Summarizing Telegram sync issues**\n\nI need to provide a concise summary regarding the Telegram setup. While the plugin seems enabled, there's a warning that the empty group allowlist causes all group messages to be dropped, which means direct messages should be fine. However, I might mention that the Telegram channel appears configured, but the group sync or message delivery isn't completely healthy due to the empty allowlist. Keeping it clear will help the user understand the situation better!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0969faa924930c1c0169c31ed66b208191919ecd9dc0e2842d\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpwx7ZnbuwyrAO3sjZp70mLpSeHGHy797AAMaoMPuhi25TXovuIEGhUqB0K-jCJrxRdlynSWeFPiUcy_wI0iGzs8evjy_60t_MW9TqY_uunfZ7JHj7vd1fMvyVBtovmKHNbL0Mm1RS3HKIGUryXCKz9ZOZySIdHLhAVK4CBVZIuJ96CA1cqs0NVvbaYKcwnZbPcCQBGZL1bxV6dG17sD1YnJ9l4mnAcM6NzzsOG8rPTOh6ur9ukHMTGTnZzC2-0yXIQeoC1lXPSURd4cOWg2ghdVWiFQoJ7gqth6B44yh5FA2gUP3k1kW0KUn2kqzoRgoSXjwCQI1xjcy9eLskcFGGqAJ2HNQP8xrsfLGPhm1URWe_c4rLNnLu-r0RdZDz9TA5pXsSonuElRRzS2_w_G7vQ71BFOCVdhJ27S8Ke4USTcwjTAF0mhn8RdXkkqnontfRc6UuWos0Xjh3Ryu3vnQif7obNdaWHihgdb99v8s1PcMeJzUQvWYtdYMSmyB8AGDiVNVexjMnjC4iijhLnqqD4-nMrGr68n9DW-Eu3pT9jWN2Nn6LvJfeadR0DcKmW5N0ZjXvOjiZvq4maOWC4mccLRbpdZbEz-JEjltlmqDk5xD2UNXx44rU7OHml450OlXA_nFPngjO4RaGwKDulp62xjLaijERtOQA2IAyr2Bm10L9Bf8O0C04e4BxWAViiBnf339_v53ZfRoObntkB3zMGtmGFXAx_0XHVRJPE5Ffkh7Kj3wYKsX1EgjBlcUrPRvXksOGvgFzwmeC7IrYODbaqXGhTWMLEs0PivDOgLyMKVruIJ2pjQqV1X_RzZjzpJw3RYerJzgsQ8Mb4Bx-xZY8j-cLnkHYwvYPqcS6iYjgfM_nsFjIzdkzjpP6eGQWY4elSoe3wEwTRBv3urck_1dbhvnJRkyithPNLTTNNZAdLws7b3k8z6Q-J9UQ6_rzKR7AU-cvQcqfcCONWcqVqNtfFcFg89mZt3cNN19r1dXQiN_KaDCqkznjb-6k2RqUbWGIXFOl8f-KAi8SlzZU2w8sT2duwDliBqneNLjA2-u7IYv5ChbVsDKRxXhz9bud5Hr3p3lPgsd-M3pBWv-C5DmGuvm8GRLEtH1tXKpACe5fwpJh1MJVJUO7-iZT_G-E-n1WZQ4kmlImnm2TFvLBdZc5bewyba5EQy3fU5UXX9AwciOm4oZuwEnLSqUQMaHFbuVUG3XFY1GkLMZHRD2oJYHfstFRhw==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Summarizing Telegram sync issues**\\n\\nI need to provide a concise summary regarding the Telegram setup. While the plugin seems enabled, there's a warning that the empty group allowlist causes all group messages to be dropped, which means direct messages should be fine. However, I might mention that the Telegram channel appears configured, but the group sync or message delivery isn't completely healthy due to the empty allowlist. Keeping it clear will help the user understand the situation better!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Daily update check complete.\n\nOpenClaw:\n- Update available: stable channel → npm package `2026.3.23-2`\n- Install method: `pnpm`\n- Suggested command: `openclaw update`\n\nSkills:\n- `npx skills check` reports checked skills are up to date\n- 77 skills cannot be version-checked automatically because they have no version hash metadata\n- No confirmed skill updates were detected\n\nTelegram channel sync / health:\n- Telegram channel is enabled in config\n- Telegram plugin is enabled\n- However, the runtime emitted a warning:\n  - `channels.telegram.groupPolicy` is `allowlist`\n  - `groupAllowFrom` / `allowFrom` is empty\n  - Result: all Telegram group messages will be silently dropped\n- So Telegram is configured, but group delivery is not fully healthy until the allowlist is populated or `groupPolicy` is changed to `open`\n\nRecommended next steps:\n1. Run `openclaw update`\n2. Fix Telegram group allowlist if group delivery is expected\n3. No immediate action needed for skills unless you want to manually refresh the non-versioned skill sources","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0969faa924930c1c0169c31ed93a6081918b3d265e9b4f883b\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":5128,"output":300,"cacheRead":22656,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28084,"co